# barbituric_acid.msf
# Barbituric acid (2,4,6-pyrimidinetrione)
# pKa=4.010 (C5-H deprotonation; charge delocalises to N-CO-N enolate)
# Source: Perrin 1981
# First C-H acid in the training set — malonyl-type acidic CH2
# flanked by two lactam carbonyls. Anion written as enolate for
# RDKit compatibility; DFT will find the correct delocalised structure.

